      ],
      "en": "The height of the one pillar was eighteen cubits, and a capital of bronze was on it. The height of the capital was three cubits, with network and pomegranates on the capital around it, all of bronze; and the second pillar with its network was like these.",
      "ko": "그 한 기둥은 고가 십 팔 규빗이요 그 꼭대기에 놋머리가 있어 고가 삼 규빗이요 그 머리에 둘린 그물과 석류가 다 놋이라 다른 기둥의 장식과 그물도 이와 같았더라",
      "source_text_hash": "70c3784a483f77c3203857330796f28fa530ae06ca758787a9b002043e1e0513",
      "translation_text_hash": "e1f4768731e741974a8f136b68fba5904a378aa32e9d4bb8af2c62650fd93509",
