      "en": "Nebuzaradan the captain of the guard took them, and brought them to the king of Babylon to Riblah.",
      "ko": "시위대 장관 느부사라단이 저희를 잡아가지고 립나 바벨론 왕에게 나아가매",
      "source_text_hash": "82d6a4a90ff2958c8ee7a296db5ac1d11a322ef7ff07a95d006a053e66ffd8dd",
